    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ballad</strong> is a\u00a0musical 3D adventure  game ! <br><br>Embark on this cosy journey where you\u00a0will play as Key, a Kalimba player bard and this instrument will be your only tool in order to progress in this game. <br>As a bard, you resolve all dangers by the magic of music, so you don't need HP, or game over, you are free to enjoy your exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometime you will have to understand the world around you and echoes its melodies, sometime you will have to use the songs you've learnt in order to explore deeper.<br>Anyway you will always be free to jam or enjoy playing your instrument under a coconut tree and chill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>You will be able to call, interact, sooth the people of the island and much more thanks to your musical instrument, try to know a bit more about the different biomes villagers and their musical lifestyle.<br><br><i>The game is designed to be played with a controller but the keyboard is also supported.</i><br> <br><i>More details coming soon</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ballad</strong> is a\u00a0musical 3D adventure  game ! <br><br>Embark on this cosy journey where you\u00a0will play as Key, a Kalimba player bard and this instrument will be your only tool in order to progress in this game. <br>As a bard, you resolve all dangers by the magic of music, so you don't need HP, or game over, you are free to enjoy your exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometime you will have to understand the world around you and echoes its melodies, sometime you will have to use the songs you've learnt in order to explore deeper.<br>Anyway you will always be free to jam or enjoy playing your instrument under a coconut tree and chill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>You will be able to call, interact, sooth the people of the island and much more thanks to your musical instrument, try to know a bit more about the different biomes villagers and their musical lifestyle.<br><br><i>The game is designed to be played with a controller but the keyboard is also supported.</i><br> <br><i>More details coming soon</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Ballad is a musical cosy 3rd person 3D adventure game. Explore several biomes, discover melodies in order to call, help, sooth, interact with the world and villagers around you thanks to your Kalimba ! Or just chill and jam in a colorful place, whatever you choose, magic of music awaits you !",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
